WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.438 --> 00:00:03.438
Lesson fifteen. Bedtime!

2
00:00:04.362 --> 00:00:11.646
Hello, hello! Hello, hello! Wave your hand, and say hello! Hello!

3
00:00:12.609 --> 00:00:14.243
Coco, I'm sleepy!

4
00:00:14.293 --> 00:00:17.709
It's night time. Let's get ready for bed!

5
00:00:18.570 --> 00:00:21.887
Bed! Say it with me. Bed!

6
00:00:25.834 --> 00:00:29.284
Pillow! Say it with me. Pillow!

7
00:00:33.358 --> 00:00:37.158
Blanket! Say it with me. Blanket!

8
00:00:41.145 --> 00:00:44.845
Moon! Say it with me. Moon!

9
00:00:48.790 --> 00:00:52.090
Star! Say it with me. Star!

10
00:00:56.090 --> 00:00:59.173
Sleep! Say it with me. Sleep!

11
00:01:03.239 --> 00:01:07.522
Look up! I see the moon. I see a star!

12
00:01:11.514 --> 00:01:16.978
Yawn! Stretch! Close your eyes.

13
00:01:17.028 --> 00:01:18.540
Good night, Coco!

14
00:01:18.590 --> 00:01:20.209
Good night, Mimi!

15
00:01:21.377 --> 00:01:27.394
Shh. Quiet, please. Sleep, sleep, sleep.

16
00:01:30.382 --> 00:01:37.665
This is O. O is for octopus. Octopus! O is for ox. Ox!

17
00:01:41.692 --> 00:01:48.849
Bye-bye, bye-bye! See you soon! Wave your hand. Bye-bye, bye-bye!

18
00:01:48.899 --> 00:01:50.630
Bye-bye, friends!

